---
// Guides 04 Component
---
<section class="v6-section bg-white">
  <div class="sec-container">
    <div class="sec-header-row">
      <div>
        <span class="sec-num">GUIDES · 04</span>
        <h2>Free reading. Buy only when you want the app.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="guides-badge-box">
        <span class="g-badge">NO EMAIL GATE</span>
        <span class="g-badge">NO ADSENSE</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="guides-list">
      <a href="/guides/export-chatgpt-conversations/" class="guide-row">
        <span class="g-num">guide · 01</span>
        <div class="g-info">
          <h3>Export ChatGPT conversations</h3>
          <p>Step-by-step instructions on archiving full ChatGPT history to local JSON and Markdown files.</p>
        </div>
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/export-claude-chat-history/" class="guide-row">
        <span class="g-num">guide · 02</span>
        <div class="g-info">
          <h3>Download Claude history</h3>
          <p>How to secure your Anthropic Claude project logs, multi-file conversations, and coding artifacts.</p>
        </div>
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/backup-perplexity-threads/" class="guide-row">
        <span class="g-num">guide · 03</span>
        <div class="g-info">
          <h3>Back up Perplexity threads</h3>
          <p>Preserve deep research collections, thread attachments, and citation metadata before pruning.</p>
        </div>
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/gemini-takeout-archive/" class="guide-row">
        <span class="g-num">guide · 04</span>
        <div class="g-info">
          <h3>Convert Google Takeout for Gemini</h3>
          <p>Parse Google's massive JSON archive bundles into clean, searchable Markdown documents.</p>
        </div>
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/own-your-ai-chat-data/" class="guide-row">
        <span class="g-num">guide · 05</span>
        <div class="g-info">
          <h3>Why owning your AI chat data matters</h3>
          <p>An essay on data portability, cloud lock-in, and the importance of permanent local archives.</p>
        </div>
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .v6-section {
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
  }
  .bg-white { background: #FFFFFF; }
  .sec-header-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }
  .guides-badge-box {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .g-badge {
    background: #EFF6FF;
    color: #2F7BFF;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid #DBEAFE;
  }
  .guides-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }
  .guide-row {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.02);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .guide-row:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    border-color: #2F7BFF;
  }
  .g-num {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #64748B;
    font-weight: 600;
    min-width: 80px;
  }
  .g-info {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .guide-row h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0F172A;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
  }
  .guide-row p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #475569;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .guide-row svg {
    color: #94A3B8;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .guide-row:hover svg {
    color: #2F7BFF;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .sec-header-row { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; }
  }
</style>
